{"schema":"LAW_EN_DOCUMENT_V1","id":"i18n-e12e73b58ef909f5f397ba1e85e8b2b91837cc17f3cc8423","family_id":"KR:006574","country":"KR","language":"en","title":"Enforcement Rules of the Traffic, Energy and Environment Tax Act","title_original":"교통ㆍ에너지ㆍ환경세법 시행규칙","kind":"기획재정부령","source_version":"270243","promulgated":null,"effective":null,"translation_status":"AI_DRAFT","body_status":"BODY_LOADED","source_url":"https://www.law.go.kr/LSW/lsInfoP.do?lsiSeq=270243","source_sha256":"99129fa87198dde7d65113cb7db1fbce6f402e0eebdd4849d79cfbe3f5e1d12e","body_sha256":"f9b939b4d2677b49bb0e4d852e83ddaf1889dbb258b127b578af07822639c028","article_count":0,"full_text":"[Attached Form No. 7] <Amended on April 5, 2007>\n\n(Front)\n\nTraffic, Energy and Environment Tax — Tax-Exempt Release\n[ ] Export  [ ] Military Supply\n[ ] Application for Approval  [ ] Approval\n\nProcessing period: 5 days.\n\nApplicant (Releasing Party)\n\n| ① Name (representative) | ② Resident (corporate) registration number |\n|---|---|\n| | |\n| ③ Business name (corporate name) | ④ Telephone number |\n| | |\n| ⑤ Address (location of head office) | |\n| | |\n| ⑥ Place of sale / release | ⑦ Business registration number |\n| | |\n\nDetails of Application\n\n<table>\n<tr><th>⑧ Name of article</th><th>⑨ Quantity</th><th>⑩ Specifications</th><th>⑪ Unit price</th><th>⑫ Price</th><th>⑬ Tax rate</th><th>⑭ Tax amount</th><th>⑮ Description</th></tr>\n<tr><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</table>\n\n| ⑯ Export destination (military-supply recipient) | |\n|---|---|\n| ⑰ Name of export customs office | |\n\nExporter (Supplier)\n\n| ⑱ Name (representative) | (Signature or seal) | ⑲ Resident (corporate) registration number | |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| ⑳ Business name (corporate name) | | ㉑ Business registration number | |\n| ㉒ Address (location of head office) | | | |\n\n| ㉓ Planned date of release | Year ____ Month ____ Day ____ | ㉔ Deadline for submitting certificate of use | Year ____ Month ____ Day ____ |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| ㉕ Reasons for applying for approval | Article 13 (1), subparagraph ____ of the Traffic, Energy and Environment Tax Act | | |\n| ㉖ Matters for reference | | | |\n\nI apply for approval for tax-exempt release pursuant to Article 13 (1) of the Traffic, Energy and Environment Tax Act.\n\nYear ____ Month ____ Day ____\nApplicant: ____________________ (Signature or seal)\n\nTo the Head of the Tax Office / Customs Office\n\nNo. ______\n\nApproval is granted as set out above on condition that a certificate of use is submitted by Year ____ Month ____ Day ____.\n\nYear ____ Month ____ Day ____\nHead of the Tax Office / Customs Office: ____________________ [Seal]\n\nTo: ____________________\n\nRequired documents: A copy of the export letter of credit or supply contract.\n※ This application form is distributed free of charge.\nFee: None.\n\nGeneral paper, 60 g/m² (recycled), or newsprint, 54 g/m² (recycled)\n\n(Reverse)\n\nThis application is processed as follows.\n\n<table>\n<tr><th>Applicant</th><th>Processing authority: Head of the tax office / customs office having jurisdiction over the place of business</th></tr>\n<tr><td>1. Prepare application</td><td>2. Receive application (Civil Service Office)</td></tr>\n<tr><td></td><td>3. Investigate and verify (Department in charge)</td></tr>\n<tr><td></td><td>4. Decide (Final decision delegated to the department head)</td></tr>\n<tr><td></td><td>5. Prepare approval certificate (Department in charge)</td></tr>\n</table>\n\nThe application proceeds from box 1 to box 2 on the right, then downward through boxes 3, 4, and 5. The final arrow from box 5 runs left and upward to the applicant and is labelled “Issue approval certificate.”\n","metadata":{"author_method":"Exact held-source units translated or completed using explicitly recorded source/target spans; original official records remain unchanged. All new units are MACHINE_TRANSLATION and UNREVIEWED.","author_source_review_evidence":[{"evidence":{"exact_author_input":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1526_KR000623\\translations\\author_inputs\\bc983949d570f5413dd3a44458be46f793eb6d524b183665bf2730e9a80d6dd2.ascii.json","sha256":"bc983949d570f5413dd3a44458be46f793eb6d524b183665bf2730e9a80d6dd2"},"protocol":"WORKC_P04_1526_EXPLICIT_SOURCE_REVIEWED_AUTHOR_INPUT_V1","reviewed_source_units":[{"source_component_text_sha256":"b1e4a463c7501dd3f653fb7c1f83a82eaf52ba14dd05fe09686702b840d28444","unit_key":"form-000700F"},{"source_component_text_sha256":"b26c129f82d4bacf505211a448a76a4c380f55c49236b642b8149f576822a358","unit_key":"form-000800F"}],"source_component_text_sha256":"b1e4a463c7501dd3f653fb7c1f83a82eaf52ba14dd05fe09686702b840d28444","source_law_id":"kr-006574-270243-ko","source_review_complete":true,"source_xml_sha256":"99129fa87198dde7d65113cb7db1fbce6f402e0eebdd4849d79cfbe3f5e1d12e","target_body_sha256":"2d183fb435af34b735ed179f501b8eafd275041971191d46f72f8247abaa5305","unit_key":"form-000700F"},"unit_key":"form-000700F"}],"author_title_record":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1526_KR000623\\translations\\rule\\en.title.json","sha256":"caf0dcf5c50a9f70581ce8b6bff50b953f3d3a7a30a17edbf83172f05b5f4e7e"},"author_unit_artifacts":[{"json":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1526_KR000623\\translations\\rule\\en.units.parts\\form-000700F.json","sha256":"104198f560e5c080d7e92c1586e12a0ebf92d0654802d13047fe5ba9792a8f82"},"selfcheck":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1526_KR000623\\translations\\rule\\en.units.parts\\form-000700F.selfcheck.json","sha256":"b48482e28028